msgctxt "92"
msgid "Hey, thanks for the directions! I finally found the spot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Here you go! One heaping helping of piping-hot rafute soba! And since you "
"seemed so enthusiastic about it, I added a little extra pork on the house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Mmph... This stuff is incredible! Heck, I could eat it every day for the "
"rest of my life and still get ravenous for more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"\"Rafute,\" huh? I suppose that's Okinawan for \"braised pork.\" But man, "
"it's a real treat. Did you know they simmer it with the skin left on? It's "
"to die for!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Oh, and the way that the collagen oozes out from the pig skin, straight "
"into the mouth? Pure deliciousness right there. It's like a supernova of "
"sweet and succulent!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "It's that good, huh? Well, I'm glad you found something you liked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Wait a minute..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Now what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "This is it! This is exactly what I needed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"I've had a vision! A vision of pig skin! It's this collagen,\r\n"
"ya see! This is what my instant ramen's been missing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"If I gingerly wrap the pork bone marrow in collagen-enriched pig skin... "
"Yes! I can taste it now! This will be the foundation for Kyushu No. 1 "
"Star's stellar tonkotsu broth!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Now all I gotta do is whip up a sample with pig skin, and the owner'll be "
"singin' my praises from here to Kamurocho!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Hehe, wait till I see the look on his face!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "That was some kid... He ate a total of ten bowls."
msgstr ""

